        {
          "text": " Daudi yaaragiira kuteeranira hamwe abanyamahanga abaabaire bari omu nsi ya Israeli, yaata ababaizi b'amabaare kubaija ag'okwombekyesa enju ya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
