            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ogwo niwe aryombekyera eiziina ryangye enju. Aryaba omwana wangye, naanye mbe ishe; kandi ndyahamya ekitebe ky'obugabe bwe omuri Israeli ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu, mwana wangye, MUKAMA agume naiwe, obone kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, ogiheze gye, nk'oku yaakugambireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
