        },
        {
          "text": " Obwo, ku orita omutima ha kworobera ebiragiro n'ebyatairweho ebi MUKAMA yaaragiira Musa ahabwa Israeli, oryaba gye. Ba ow'amaani, ogume; otatiina, kandi otahahaaza omutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
