            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 29:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Reeba, omu kufa kubi kwangye nteekateekyeire enju ya MUKAMA etalanta z'ezaabu akasiriira kamwe, n'ez'efeeza akakaikuru, n'emiringa n'ebyoma ebirengire ekigyero, ahabw'okuba ni bingi munoga; kandi nteekateekire embaaho n'amabaare. Ahari ebyo naiwe oryayongyeraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi oine abakozi baingi munonga, ababaizi b'amabaare, abombeki, ababaizi, abanyamyoga b'emiringo yoona abatarikubarwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abarikumanya kukoresa ezaabu, efeeza, emiringa n'ebyoma. Imuka okore! MUKAMA agume naiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
