        {
          "text": " Mbwenu mute omutima gwanyu gwona aha kusherura MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. Mwimukye, mwombekye Omwanya ogurikwera ogwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mubone kureeta eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, n'ebintu ebirikwera bya Ruhanga, omu nju eryombekyerwa eiziina rye.",
